{
  "name": "Rail production fidelity",
  "source": "DESIGN.md (Rail, selected 2026-10-15) and ui-harness/family-concepts/2-rail/styles.css",
  "amendment": "2026-10-15: replaces the Tonal Ledger \u2014 Canvas contract. Checks the paper system's geometry on the ledger state: the toolbar, the sidebar, the page's gutter, the meta line and title, the transport, the rail and its marks, the note and turn columns.",
